        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heavy fuel oil, burned in power plant
Emissions, materials use, infrastructure, etc. for oil input to power plants;
UUID: 869120e0-9311-3a3c-8f29-9c2e6e903dff
All energy use, use of chemicals, emissions to air and water including treatment of flue gasses and effluents.
Location: Estimation for the country.
Technology: Estimation for average technology.
Time period: Some statistical data for 2000 or recent years.
Production volume: 0.3 TWh from power plants and 2.4 TWh from combined cycle plants.
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_869120e0-9311-3a3c-8f29-9c2e6e903dff.xml</text>
